# ======================= additional ignore patterns =======================
### Java & Compiled Files ###
*.class
*.log
*.ctxt

### Packages & Archives ###
# Ignore packaged applications (if you ever build jars/wars locally)
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

### JVM Crash Logs ###
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

### Gradle ###
# (Even if using Maven, good to have if you ever switch or run a gradle wrapper)
.gradle/

### OS Specific ###
# Mac
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

### Local Environment / Secrets ###
# Ignore local-only Spring Boot property files (uncomment if you use them)
# application-local.properties
# application-local.yml
# application-secret.properties
# application-secret.yml
.env